+# MoLiAPI Kubernetes Deployment Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
+
+**Goal:** Add beginner-friendly, independently usable Kustomize and Helm configurations for minimal and full Kubernetes deployments of MoLiAPI.
+
+**Architecture:** A Kustomize base deploys MoLiAPI, MySQL, and Redis; optional Prometheus and Grafana components form the full overlay. A standalone Helm chart exposes the same component switches and defaults. Both paths reference user-created Secrets, use persistent volumes, expose only MoLiAPI through Ingress, and are checked by one PowerShell parity script.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Kubernetes `apps/v1` and `networking.k8s.io/v1`, Kustomize components, Helm 3 templates, PowerShell validation, Spring Boot Actuator, MySQL 8.4, Redis 7.4, Prometheus 3, Grafana 13.
+
+---
+
+## File map
+
+Create the following implementation units:
+
+- `k8s/kustomize/base/`: common Namespace, application, MySQL, Redis, storage, Services, Ingress, and Secret template.
+- `k8s/kustomize/components/prometheus/`: optional Prometheus config, workload, Service, and storage.
+- `k8s/kustomize/components/grafana/`: optional Grafana datasource, workload, Service, and storage.
+- `k8s/kustomize/overlays/minimal/`: core-only composition and beginner-editable patches.
+- `k8s/kustomize/overlays/full/`: core plus Prometheus and Grafana.
+- `k8s/helm/moliapi/`: independent chart with equivalent switches and defaults.
+- `k8s/config/`: commented reference copies of Prometheus and Grafana datasource configuration.
+- `k8s/scripts/validate.ps1`: rendering and parity checks for both deployment paths.
+- `k8s/README.md`: Docker Compose to Kubernetes mapping, deployment operations, and troubleshooting.
+- `.gitignore`: ignore local Kubernetes Secret and values override files.
+
+Pinned default images, verified against official releases on 2026-06-30:
+
+| Component | Image |
+| --- | --- |
+| MoLiAPI | `bingchunmoli/moliapi:v3.15.11` |
+| MySQL | `mysql:8.4.10` |
+| Redis | `redis:7.4.9-alpine` |
+| Prometheus | `prom/prometheus:v3.12.0` |
+| Grafana | `grafana/grafana:13.0.2` |
+| Init container | `busybox:1.37.0` |
+
+## Configuration contract
+
+Both Kustomize and Helm must produce these names and ports:
+
+| Resource | Name | Port |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Application Service | `moliapi` | `8090` |
+| MySQL Service | `moliapi-mysql` | `3306` |
+| Redis Service | `moliapi-redis` | `6379` |
+| Prometheus Service | `moliapi-prometheus` | `9090` |
+| Grafana Service | `moliapi-grafana` | `3000` |
+| Required Secret | `moliapi-secrets` | Not applicable |
+
+The Secret keys are `MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD`, `MYSQL_PASSWORD`, `REDIS_PASSWORD`, and `GF_SECURITY_ADMIN_PASSWORD`.
+No resource may contain Loki, Promtail, Alloy, standalone Nginx, or Nginx Exporter.
+
+### Task 1: Add the executable rendering contract
